-asia.com/luoi-rao-vuon-bao-ve-vuon-tuoc-hieu-qua-tham-my&quot;&gt;lưới rào vườn&lt;/a&gt; hàng rào gấp tam giác 2 đầu phổ biến.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;h2 data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:42&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lựa Chọn Loại Lưới Hàng Rào Phù Hợp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:25&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mục đích sử dụng:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-28:0&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:51&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;Khu &lt;em loopnumber=&quot;289795831&quot; match=&quot;cô&quot;&gt;cô&lt;/em&gt;ng nghiệp: Lưới thép mạ kẽm,&lt;a href=&quot;http://namlong-asia.com/hang-rao-luoi-thep-han&quot;&gt; lưới thép hàn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-28:0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;Khu dân cư: Lưới thép chấn sóng, hàng rào gấp tam giác 2 đầu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ngân sách:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-32:0&quot;&gt;\r\n	&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-32:0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;Lưới thép mạ kẽm rẻ nhất, lưới thép hàn, lưới thép chấn sóng, hàng rào gấp t